SUMMARY:Artist Talk: Artists’ Alliance & Tattooed Walls
LOCATION:Acadiana Center for the Arts\, 101 W Vermilion St\, Lafayette
DESCRIPTION:Join former members of the Artists' Alliance as they perform a 
 demonstration of one of their most famous art formats: Tattooed Walls. Thr
 ough the use of an overhead projector\, Tattooed Walls turns visual artmak
 ing into a shifting performance piece that transforms in real time. As bui
 lding sized images take shape\, warp\, and disappear\, musicians and dance
 rs respond in kind\, creating a jazz-like improvisational experience that 
 defies disciplinary boundaries. After the performance\, our artists will j
 oin AcA Visual Arts Director Jaik Faulk in a discussion of their inspirati
 ons and process\, as well as the history and legacy of the Tattoed Walls f
 orm.\n\nhttps://acadianacenterforthearts.org/events/artists-alliance-and-t
 attooed-walls/?occurrence=2026-12-12
URL:https://acadianacenterforthearts.org/events/artists-alliance-and-tattoo
 ed-walls/?occurrence=2026-12-12
